%!PS-Adobe-3.0
%%BoundingBox: 0 0 612 792
%%Title: Print Head Maintenance Test Page
%%Creator: nixos_config
%%Pages: 1
%%EndComments

% Weekly print-head maintenance page for the Epson ET-4850 (4-color CMYK).
% Solid CMYK blocks exercise every ink channel; the R/G/B patches check color
% mixing; fine lines reveal clogged nozzles (missing line = clogged head).

/Helvetica-Bold findfont 20 scalefont setfont
54 732 moveto (Epson ET-4850 - Print Head Maintenance) show

/Helvetica findfont 11 scalefont setfont
54 712 moveto (Weekly test page - exercises cyan, magenta, yellow, black) show
54 698 moveto (Streaky blocks or missing lines = clogged nozzles: run nozzle check + clean) show

% --- primary CMYK blocks (84 x 84 pts each) ---
1 0 0 0 setcmykcolor        % cyan
54 580 84 84 rectfill
0 1 0 0 setcmykcolor        % magenta
148 580 84 84 rectfill
0 0 1 0 setcmykcolor        % yellow
242 580 84 84 rectfill
0 0 0 1 setcmykcolor        % black
336 580 84 84 rectfill

/Helvetica findfont 10 scalefont setfont
0 0 0 0 setcmykcolor
54 568 moveto (Cyan) show
148 568 moveto (Magenta) show
242 568 moveto (Yellow) show
336 568 moveto (Black) show

% --- secondary colors (check color mixing) ---
0 1 1 0 setcmykcolor        % red
54 450 84 84 rectfill
1 0 1 0 setcmykcolor        % green
148 450 84 84 rectfill
1 1 0 0 setcmykcolor        % blue
242 450 84 84 rectfill

0 0 0 0 setcmykcolor
54 438 moveto (Red) show
148 438 moveto (Green) show
242 438 moveto (Blue) show

% --- fine lines (nozzle check) ---
/Helvetica findfont 10 scalefont setfont
0 0 0 0 setcmykcolor
54 380 moveto (Fine lines - missing lines indicate clogged nozzles:) show

0.5 setlinewidth

0 0 0 1 setcmykcolor
54 356 moveto 204 356 lineto stroke
54 350 moveto 204 350 lineto stroke

1 0 0 0 setcmykcolor
54 338 moveto 204 338 lineto stroke
54 332 moveto 204 332 lineto stroke

0 1 0 0 setcmykcolor
54 320 moveto 204 320 lineto stroke
54 314 moveto 204 314 lineto stroke

0 0 1 0 setcmykcolor
54 302 moveto 204 302 lineto stroke
54 296 moveto 204 296 lineto stroke

% --- footer ---
/Helvetica findfont 9 scalefont setfont
0 0 0 0 setcmykcolor
54 60 moveto (Weekly print-head maintenance page - uses a small amount of ink) show

showpage
%%EOF
